Dialogue: 30,0:00:14.91,0:00:18.16,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Sylvia wants to be like her someday.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:21.91,0:00:24.90,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You're always so amazing, Chidorigafuchi.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:24.90,0:00:27.88,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I'm tired of trite compliments like "amazing."
Dialogue: 30,0:00:28.24,0:00:30.38,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Of course, with your intellect,
Dialogue: 30,0:00:30.71,0:00:34.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's the best you're capable of.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:35.21,0:00:36.64,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Well, {\i1}sorry{\i0}.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:36.93,0:00:40.69,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,And I was only up against one of the Engineering Division's dummy Magitech weapons.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:40.69,0:00:41.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course it was that easy.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:41.92,0:00:42.89,Dialogue,Gu,0,0,0,,Well, {\i1}sorry{\i0}!
Dialogue: 30,0:00:47.61,0:00:48.90,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,After all,
Dialogue: 30,0:00:48.90,0:00:51.40,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,fighting's my only purpose.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:52.40,0:00:53.63,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Cut them apart!
Dialogue: 30,0:00:53.63,0:00:54.15,Dialogue Alternate,H,0,0,0,,Blade!
Dialogue: 30,0:00:57.07,0:00:58.32,Dialogue Alternate,Y,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 30,0:01:06.62,0:01:08.50,Dialogue,Gu,0,0,0,,Himekawa's the best!
Dialogue: 30,0:01:09.50,0:01:11.05,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Julicia-sama!
Dialogue: 30,0:01:11.75,0:01:15.47,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,The destructive powers of Neros and Kuros are on a whole other level, aren't they?
Dialogue: 30,0:01:15.73,0:01:20.47,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,We need to develop weapons as good as Amaterasu's, too!
Dialogue: 30,0:01:21.74,0:01:22.96,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Chidorigafuchi?
