Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.61,0:02:57.57,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(425,480)\bord2.4\blur1.5\c&HFCFCFD&\fsp3\pos(598.5,1049.715)}Gentle Days - Memories
Dialogue: 30,0:02:55.03,0:02:57.91,Dialogue Top,R,0,0,0,,So that data was accurate after all.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:59.91,0:03:03.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After Aine, Julicia succeeded in performing a Heart Hybrid, too.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:04.66,0:03:07.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now we can proceed as planned.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:08.75,0:03:09.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 30,0:03:11.96,0:03:14.84,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,The genius scientist, Dr. Hida Nayuta,
Dialogue: 30,0:03:14.84,0:03:18.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,developed our strongest weapons and\N the only ones that can take on Magitech,
Dialogue: 30,0:03:18.30,0:03:19.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the Heart Hybrid Gears.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:20.18,0:03:20.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 30,0:03:20.80,0:03:26.06,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Great power always comes at an even greater price, huh?
Dialogue: 30,0:03:27.56,0:03:32.23,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,That woman, I wonder what she's feeling right now.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:36.74,0:03:38.61,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Kizuna!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:40.82,0:03:42.58,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,J-Julicia?
Dialogue: 30,0:03:43.08,0:03:46.58,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,So, what did you think of my performance during the training exercise?
Dialogue: 30,0:03:47.16,0:03:50.21,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,You fell in love with me a little, didn't you?
Dialogue: 30,0:03:50.58,0:03:52.42,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,W-Well...
Dialogue: 30,0:03:53.13,0:03:55.80,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,It's no wonder you're America's ace.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:55.80,0:03:58.09,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I was impressed. Really.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:59.09,0:04:01.10,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Do you really mean that?
Dialogue: 30,0:04:01.60,0:04:03.93,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Then give me a reward.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:07.85,0:04:09.10,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 30,0:04:09.10,0:04:10.85,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Fantastic!
Dialogue: 30,0:04:11.98,0:04:15.23,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Why did you choose to go to Kyoto float as your reward?
Dialogue: 30,0:04:15.73,0:04:19.32,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Because I've always wanted to have a chance to go sightseeing.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:19.32,0:04:20.32,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Hey, Kizuna,
Dialogue: 30,0:04:20.32,0:04:21.99,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,is this temple the real deal?
Dialogue: 30,0:04:22.37,0:04:23.66,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,It's a replica.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:23.66,0:04:29.12,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,There wasn't enough time to get all \Nour cultural assets aboard the megafloats.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:29.46,0:04:30.62,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:30.62,0:04:33.13,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,I want to see the real one someday.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:33.84,0:04:35.17,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You can.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:35.17,0:04:36.88,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Once we all go back to Japan.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:37.80,0:04:40.38,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,That's why we're fighting.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:43.64,0:04:44.93,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Okay, Kizuna.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:44.93,0:04:47.02,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,On to the next one!
Dialogue: 30,0:04:47.02,0:04:48.39,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Huh, next one?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.52,0:04:53.52,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\fax-0.1\fnMarkerFeltWide-Plain\blur1.5\bord4.5\3c&HE5E3E7&\c&H50413D&\pos(456,690.999)\frz24.07\frx358\fry358}Takoyaki
Dialogue: 30,0:04:56.15,0:04:59.15,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I didn't expect to spend the day touring the megafloat.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:59.15,0:05:01.03,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,It's not that big,
Dialogue: 30,0:05:01.03,0:05:03.66,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,but it feels like we've traveled all over Japan.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:04.16,0:05:06.66,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Sorry for dragging you along.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:07.04,0:05:09.62,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,But it was so much fun!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:09.62,0:05:12.58,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You're really outgoing, Julicia.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:12.58,0:05:16.17,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Not many people would act on a crazy idea like this, even if they did think of it.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:17.17,0:05:18.46,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:18.46,0:05:20.92,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,I think I've changed.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:21.30,0:05:22.43,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Changed?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:23.01,0:05:26.60,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,When we were attacked by \Nthat Magitech weapon on that island,
Dialogue: 30,0:05:27.47,0:05:30.43,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,For the first time in my life, I thought I might die.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:31.06,0:05:35.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But when you saved me, this is what I felt:
Dialogue: 30,0:05:36.73,0:05:38.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to make the most of my life.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:38.69,0:05:39.69,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Julicia.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:40.40,0:05:43.32,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,I want to make the most of it.\N I want to have more fun.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:43.78,0:05:46.78,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,I want to do more things, like falling in love.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:47.58,0:05:50.33,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,No, I...
Dialogue: 30,0:05:50.66,0:05:53.96,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,It's thanks to you that I can feel like this.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:54.50,0:05:55.46,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:59.05,0:06:01.34,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I don't mind her saying thanks,
Dialogue: 30,0:06:01.84,0:06:03.76,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,but I don't know about this...
Dialogue: 30,0:06:08.85,0:06:11.73,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Hey, is that you, Himekawa?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:11.73,0:06:13.10,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Hida-kun?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:14.81,0:06:17.61,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Do you always stay at school this late?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:18.15,0:06:20.23,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,The disciplinary committee sure has it rough.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:20.23,0:06:22.99,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,There's no end of students causing problems.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:23.61,0:06:27.07,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Especially lewd boys.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:31.66,0:06:34.87,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,But I like this school.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:34.87,0:06:39.75,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I want to make the lives of my fellow students as fun as possible.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:40.38,0:06:43.17,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,That is my desire,
Dialogue: 30,0:06:43.17,0:06:44.63,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,as well as my duty.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:51.39,0:06:54.02,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You're really dedicated, huh?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:54.98,0:06:56.85,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I like that about you.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:56.85,0:06:58.44,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Y-You love that?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:58.44,0:07:00.32,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you saying?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:00.32,0:07:00.90,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,That's indecent!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:15.08,0:07:17.17,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Himekawa...
Dialogue: 30,0:07:17.62,0:07:20.17,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,H-Hida-kun...
Dialogue: 30,0:07:33.18,0:07:34.93,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,A Heart Hybrid?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:35.48,0:07:36.77,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,In an instant?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:37.35,0:07:38.35,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:41.02,0:07:43.86,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,How could I be so perverted?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:54.24,0:07:55.70,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Chidorigafuchi?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:56.46,0:07:58.96,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Aine-san's always like that.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:59.46,0:08:01.63,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,She always trains by herself.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:01.63,0:08:05.26,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I wanted to spar with her once, \Nbut when I went up to talk to her,
Dialogue: 30,0:08:05.26,0:08:06.59,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,she ignored me.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:06.59,0:08:09.72,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,At this point, everyone keeps their distance from her.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:10.09,0:08:12.97,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,She has a strange obsession with fighting.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:13.76,0:08:18.73,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Julicia-san and I don't know what she's thinking, either.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:19.56,0:08:21.73,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Even though we're all part of Amaterasu.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:23.48,0:08:24.65,Dialogue Flashback,Y,0,0,0,,After all,
Dialogue: 30,0:08:24.65,0:08:27.53,Dialogue Flashback,Y,0,0,0,,fighting's my only purpose.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:35.66,0:08:38.96,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,{\q2}So he managed to do a Heart Hybrid with Himekawa, too?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:41.50,0:08:44.42,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Guess I can't run away anymore.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:46.21,0:08:48.05,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Chidorigafuchi-san?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:48.51,0:08:51.47,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,She joined the academy during high school,
Dialogue: 30,0:08:51.47,0:08:53.18,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,so I don't know the details.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:53.55,0:08:56.06,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Come to think of it,
Dialogue: 30,0:08:56.06,0:08:57.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've never seen her smile.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:57.72,0:08:59.60,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 30,0:09:00.77,0:09:02.35,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 30,0:09:03.02,0:09:04.44,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Can I go?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:04.44,0:09:06.73,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 30,0:09:06.73,0:09:09.70,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,What's this about me?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:14.16,0:09:15.70,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,Well, this sucks.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:16.03,0:09:18.91,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,This is my chance to learn about Chidorigafuchi,
Dialogue: 30,0:09:18.91,0:09:21.71,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,but what do I say to her?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:24.08,0:09:24.71,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:25.71,0:09:27.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you eaten yet?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:27.75,0:09:30.01,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,No, not yet.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:30.01,0:09:30.72,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:31.34,0:09:34.80,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll let you have this.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:35.47,0:09:37.10,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Be grateful.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:40.10,0:09:42.52,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Th-That looks good.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:42.52,0:09:44.44,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Are these handmade?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:44.44,0:09:45.36,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:45.81,0:09:48.19,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I bought them at a convenience store, cut them in half,
Dialogue: 30,0:09:48.19,0:09:49.90,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,and put them in a lunchbox.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:49.90,0:09:52.36,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I don't think that qualifies as handmade.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:52.65,0:09:53.57,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:54.32,0:09:57.37,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Then what's the definition of handmade?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:57.66,0:09:58.20,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:00.20,0:10:02.87,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,How strict's the definition?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:02.87,0:10:05.04,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,If I can't use something that's already made,
Dialogue: 30,0:10:05.04,0:10:08.88,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I'd have to grow the wheat for the bread myself, right?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:09.63,0:10:12.63,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Oh, and I'd have to go catch the tuna, too.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:13.09,0:10:16.18,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I'll be right back. Can you wait here?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:17.14,0:10:18.39,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:18.39,0:10:20.22,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I appreciate it very much!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:20.81,0:10:22.39,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,As long as you understand.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:26.15,0:10:28.40,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,What am I doing here again?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:32.99,0:10:34.40,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:34.40,0:10:35.36,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:35.99,0:10:39.24,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,There's one other thing I want you to have.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:39.24,0:10:40.91,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Dessert or something?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:45.75,0:10:47.92,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,H-Hey, you can't mean—?!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:47.92,0:10:50.67,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you doing? \NWe're in broad daylight!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:51.00,0:10:56.76,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I read in one of those books that if you do it in a place like this,
Dialogue: 30,0:10:56.76,0:10:59.43,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,the immorality of it turns the guy on more.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:59.43,0:11:01.18,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Exactly what kind of book was that?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:01.18,0:11:02.18,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I-It doesn't matter!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:02.64,0:11:07.69,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Come on, do a Heart Hybrid with me right now!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:11.32,0:11:13.24,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Are you...?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:14.95,0:11:18.57,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you talking about, you inferior life form?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:18.99,0:11:22.45,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Do you think that I, of all people, \Nwould be scared of something like this?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:22.45,0:11:24.08,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,But you're trembling.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:24.08,0:11:27.04,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I'm about to get my Immoral Weapon.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:27.04,0:11:28.83,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I'm trembling because I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:28.83,0:11:30.71,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Immoral Weapon?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:30.71,0:11:32.34,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What's that... Wait!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:39.39,0:11:41.35,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Is this still not good enough?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:43.89,0:11:45.43,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,Why am I getting turned on?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:45.43,0:11:49.15,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,I bet she's wearing a pilot suit underneath like before—
Dialogue: 30,0:11:49.15,0:11:50.61,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,Or not!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:52.65,0:11:54.94,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Go ahead. You can touch them.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:54.94,0:11:56.49,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 30,0:11:56.82,0:11:58.11,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Hurry up.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:58.11,0:11:59.49,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,W-Wait!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:59.49,0:12:00.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wai—
Dialogue: 30,0:12:04.16,0:12:06.25,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,They're so soft...
Dialogue: 30,0:12:08.33,0:12:10.25,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Th-This is weird!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:10.25,0:12:12.29,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You can't force it...
Dialogue: 30,0:12:13.00,0:12:15.42,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,And you have to think about how the other person feels.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:15.42,0:12:17.26,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:18.26,0:12:20.26,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I can't lose.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:20.97,0:12:25.64,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I can't let Julicia and Hayuru beat me forever.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:25.93,0:12:27.06,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 30,0:12:27.06,0:12:29.35,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I want power.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:29.35,0:12:30.65,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,And for that...
Dialogue: 30,0:12:31.77,0:12:33.57,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I don't care what happens to me!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:39.65,0:12:40.70,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:05.22,0:13:06.10,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 30,0:13:07.47,0:13:10.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we're doing a Heart Hybrid, right?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:26.37,0:13:27.62,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I can't do it.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:28.25,0:13:30.66,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Not when you've got that look on your face.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:31.29,0:13:34.21,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You don't know anything about me, right?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:34.21,0:13:37.00,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,And I don't know anything about you.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:37.00,0:13:41.38,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,So we need to take more time to learn about each other.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:42.18,0:13:43.89,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:45.35,0:13:46.60,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Impossible?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:46.60,0:13:48.01,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:51.35,0:13:52.64,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Nee-chan?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:53.73,0:13:54.86,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:54.86,0:13:56.61,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Kizuna, it's Reiri.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:57.57,0:13:59.28,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,I need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:59.28,0:14:00.82,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Can we meet?
Dialogue: 30,0:14:00.82,0:14:02.90,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:06.32,0:14:07.20,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:10.33,0:14:13.62,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Do you remember this room, Kizuna?
Dialogue: 30,0:14:13.62,0:14:14.33,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:14.75,0:14:16.29,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I could never forget it.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:16.79,0:14:17.71,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 30,0:14:18.21,0:14:19.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the place...
Dialogue: 30,0:14:20.51,0:14:22.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,where it all began.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:26.09,0:14:31.47,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I underwent the Core Installation \Nsurgery for the Heart Hybrid Gear.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:31.47,0:14:32.35,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Right here.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:34.23,0:14:35.69,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I was scared.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:35.69,0:14:39.36,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,But I did it for Mom.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:39.98,0:14:42.36,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I wanted Mom's approval,
Dialogue: 30,0:14:42.78,0:14:44.86,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,so I helped with the Gear experiment.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:45.49,0:14:46.74,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,But Mom...
Dialogue: 30,0:14:53.62,0:14:55.04,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I'll never forget.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:55.04,0:14:56.54,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:56.54,0:14:57.83,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Kizuna, actually...
Dialogue: 30,0:14:58.38,0:15:01.13,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,That aside, there was something I wanted to ask you.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:01.13,0:15:02.13,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Ask me?
Dialogue: 30,0:15:02.51,0:15:05.80,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I want you to tell me what \Nyou know about Chidorigafuchi.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:05.80,0:15:07.09,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Aine?
Dialogue: 30,0:15:07.09,0:15:07.89,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 30,0:15:07.89,0:15:09.43,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,"Why?"
Dialogue: 30,0:15:10.14,0:15:13.64,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Because I have to know about her, I think.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:14.14,0:15:16.73,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What she's like, where she came from,
Dialogue: 30,0:15:16.73,0:15:18.40,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,why she's here...
Dialogue: 30,0:15:19.11,0:15:20.23,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I want to know.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:22.73,0:15:25.15,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,There are no records of her early life.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:25.90,0:15:29.16,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Seven years ago, in Chidorigafuchi, Tokyo,
Dialogue: 30,0:15:29.78,0:15:32.70,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,a girl with no known identity was found.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:32.70,0:15:34.16,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,She had no memories
Dialogue: 30,0:15:34.62,0:15:37.29,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,and didn't remember her name or her origins.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:37.29,0:15:38.58,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Was that...?
Dialogue: 30,0:15:38.58,0:15:41.42,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Yes, that was Aine.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:43.21,0:15:46.17,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,During the physical exam she took \Nas part of the efforts to identify her,
Dialogue: 30,0:15:46.17,0:15:49.72,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,it was found that she had very high compatibility with the Gears.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:49.72,0:15:52.43,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,So the lab took her in,
Dialogue: 30,0:15:53.22,0:15:55.43,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,as an experimental subject for that woman.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:55.93,0:15:58.60,Dialogue Flashback,N,0,0,0,,Hello, Chidorigafuchi Aine-san.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:59.10,0:16:00.81,Dialogue Flashback,A,0,0,0,,Aine...
Dialogue: 30,0:16:01.73,0:16:02.61,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 30,0:16:03.57,0:16:05.44,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Chidorigafuchi Aine is the name
Dialogue: 30,0:16:05.94,0:16:07.99,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,that woman gave her.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:09.95,0:16:11.78,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,After she took her in,
Dialogue: 30,0:16:11.78,0:16:13.70,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,her life at the lab began.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:14.29,0:16:16.62,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,She did nothing but take part in experiments.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:17.29,0:16:20.08,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,But they suddenly came to an end
Dialogue: 30,0:16:20.75,0:16:22.71,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,when Hida Nayuta disappeared.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:23.55,0:16:26.80,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,That woman just disappeared one day,
Dialogue: 30,0:16:26.80,0:16:29.47,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,and we still don't know why.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:29.84,0:16:32.26,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Or, of course, where she went.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:33.51,0:16:35.97,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,That's all I know.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:36.35,0:16:37.81,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:38.60,0:16:39.48,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,She's...
Dialogue: 30,0:16:40.60,0:16:44.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's always been alone, huh?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:45.44,0:16:48.99,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,It might take time, but I'm sure we can understand each other.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:49.32,0:16:52.41,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Sorry, but our time is limited.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:53.12,0:16:54.99,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:57.20,0:17:00.92,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,The archive you're about to see was only recently discovered.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:00.92,0:17:03.75,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,Only Reiri and I know about it.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:04.25,0:17:05.38,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:05.38,0:17:06.76,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,It will link with your vision.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:07.51,0:17:09.26,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,Linkage.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:37.58,0:17:38.83,Dialogue Flashback Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,It hurts...
Dialogue: 30,0:17:38.83,0:17:40.54,Dialogue Flashback Italics,,0,0,0,,I can't take any more...
Dialogue: 30,0:17:41.08,0:17:42.04,Dialogue Flashback,Gi,0,0,0,,Continue, please.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:42.04,0:17:44.75,Dialogue Flashback Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,But my Hybrid Count...
Dialogue: 30,0:17:46.63,0:17:48.05,Dialogue Flashback,Gi,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:49.13,0:17:53.05,Dialogue Flashback,Gi,0,0,0,,We'll take control of the Gear from here, then.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:54.55,0:17:56.72,Dialogue Flashback,Gi,0,0,0,,D-Dr. Nayuta.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:56.72,0:17:59.56,Dialogue Flashback,Gi,0,0,0,,No... Doctor... stop!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:59.56,0:18:01.31,Dialogue Flashback,Foreground,0,0,0,,Output increasing.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:00.64,0:18:02.73,Dialogue Flashback Top Italics,Background,0,0,0,,Someone, stop!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:01.31,0:18:03.35,Dialogue Flashback,Foreground,0,0,0,,Count has entered the danger zone.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:02.73,0:18:07.15,Dialogue Flashback Top Italics,Background,0,0,0,,Stop it! No! I don't want to die!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:03.35,0:18:05.69,Dialogue Flashback,Foreground,0,0,0,,Subject's vitals are yellow.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:06.19,0:18:07.52,Dialogue Flashback,Count remaining,0,0,0,,Count remaining:
Dialogue: 30,0:18:07.15,0:18:09.90,Dialogue Flashback Top Italics,Background,0,0,0,,I'm going to die!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:07.52,0:18:08.53,Dialogue Flashback,Count remaining,0,0,0,,Seven.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:08.53,0:18:09.53,Dialogue Flashback,Count remaining,0,0,0,,Six.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:09.53,0:18:10.53,Dialogue Flashback,Count remaining,0,0,0,,Five.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:09.90,0:18:12.95,Dialogue Flashback Top Italics,Background,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:10.53,0:18:11.61,Dialogue Flashback,Count remaining,0,0,0,,Four.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:11.61,0:18:12.57,Dialogue Flashback,Count remaining,0,0,0,,Three.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:12.57,0:18:13.57,Dialogue Flashback,Count remaining,0,0,0,,Two.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:13.57,0:18:14.07,Dialogue Flashback,Count remaining,0,0,0,,One.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:14.07,0:18:15.53,Dialogue Flashback,Count remaining,0,0,0,,Count zero.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:15.53,0:18:16.99,Dialogue Flashback,Count remaining,0,0,0,,Vitals lost.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:16.99,0:18:20.08,Dialogue Flashback,Count remaining,0,0,0,,Increasing maximum output value by 5.0.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:20.50,0:18:21.58,Dialogue Flashback,N,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:21.58,0:18:23.83,Dialogue Flashback,N,0,0,0,,This was good data.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:30.88,0:18:32.84,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 30,0:18:32.84,0:18:34.47,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,As you just saw,
Dialogue: 30,0:18:34.47,0:18:38.85,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,the Hybrid Count is the energy \Nsource of the Heart Hybrid Gear.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:38.85,0:18:41.64,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,At the same time, it is the pilot's life energy.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:42.10,0:18:45.35,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,If the counts of Eros, Zeros, Neros, and Kuros,
Dialogue: 30,0:18:45.35,0:18:47.86,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,all entries in the Ros series, drop to zero...
Dialogue: 30,0:18:48.27,0:18:49.73,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,The pilot dies.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:51.11,0:18:53.40,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,No one knows this.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:53.40,0:18:55.24,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Not even the members of Amaterasu.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:55.74,0:18:57.07,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,But, Kizuna,
Dialogue: 30,0:18:57.07,0:19:00.54,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,as the unit commander, I wanted you to know.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:01.12,0:19:02.25,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You're kidding.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:02.83,0:19:04.75,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Then everyone...
Dialogue: 30,0:19:05.54,0:19:08.71,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,had those cores installed without knowing anything,
Dialogue: 30,0:19:08.71,0:19:11.25,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,and they're risking their lives each time they fight?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:12.21,0:19:15.55,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You knew that, and you made them fight anyway?!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:19.55,0:19:22.77,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,This fact only came to light very recently.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:23.31,0:19:27.98,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,And do you think Reiri didn't suffer when she found out?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:28.81,0:19:31.86,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Then that's just another reason to find another way!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:31.86,0:19:33.07,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,We don't...
Dialogue: 30,0:19:33.69,0:19:36.32,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,We don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:36.32,0:19:40.07,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,This is all we have to fight the enemy.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:40.41,0:19:42.04,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,So what do I do?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:42.04,0:19:44.75,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,I have to order them to fight, right?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:45.58,0:19:46.58,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Nee-chan...
Dialogue: 30,0:19:46.96,0:19:49.58,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,That is my responsibility.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:50.25,0:19:53.09,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,I'm going to hell for this, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:54.05,0:19:56.01,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,But even so...
Dialogue: 30,0:20:03.18,0:20:06.10,Dialogue Flashback,R,0,0,0,,You're our last hope, Kizuna.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:07.39,0:20:08.65,Dialogue Flashback,K,0,0,0,,The Heart Hybrid...
Dialogue: 30,0:20:09.10,0:20:12.15,Dialogue Flashback Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,You're the only one who can save their lives.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:12.73,0:20:17.53,Dialogue Flashback Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,That is the special feature of Eros, \Nthe Gear that was installed in you, a boy.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:19.11,0:20:20.53,Dialogue Flashback,K,0,0,0,,I'm the only one...
Dialogue: 30,0:20:21.12,0:20:22.08,Dialogue Flashback,K,0,0,0,,who can save them...?
Dialogue: 30,0:20:27.62,0:20:29.62,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Captain!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:30.33,0:20:31.71,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Sylvia...
Dialogue: 30,0:20:33.04,0:20:34.63,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Did you make all this?
Dialogue: 30,0:20:34.92,0:20:35.92,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Yep!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:35.92,0:20:39.38,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,It's Sylvia's job to take care of you, Captain!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:40.43,0:20:41.51,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:41.51,0:20:42.64,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,It looks good.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:45.14,0:20:47.39,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,But are you okay?
Dialogue: 30,0:20:47.77,0:20:50.14,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,You look tired.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:51.02,0:20:53.15,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,No, not at all.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:53.56,0:20:54.90,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:55.53,0:20:57.15,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,If you need anything, let me know.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:57.40,0:21:00.45,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Sylvia wants to help you, too!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:02.95,0:21:05.16,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Thanks, Sylvia.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:08.79,0:21:10.87,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,Captain, huh?
